  "description": "EF Core persistence for the Stratara event-sourced stack on PostgreSQL — write-store, read-store, ASP.NET Identity store — including a shared identity store with its migrations — shared conventions, value generators, and UnitOfWork primitives. Targets Npgsql; maps pgvector types for a model that uses them, and needs no database extension otherwise.",
